  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/gym_mizu_040.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/gym_mizu_040.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "BE32B2458977D5E2",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n欢迎你来到玻瓶道馆。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "BE32B3458977D795",
      "text": "惊涛海味料理人海岱……\\n要挑战这个道馆馆主吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "BE32B0458977D27C",
      "text": "那好，我带你去对战场吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "BE32B1458977D42F",
      "text": "等你准备好了，\\n随时都可以告诉我。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_boy_entry_01",
      "hash64": "A66AD42AF62B610B",
      "text": "海岱叔叔，\\n陪我玩，陪我玩嘛～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_woman_entry_01",
      "hash64": "3EB8108C114F97B3",
      "text": "请你一定也要来尝尝\\n我们店的新菜单。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_entry_01",
      "hash64": "9DC5825CD21ED7A0",
      "text": "抱歉啊，大伙！\\n俺接下来还有道馆的工作要做！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_entry_02",
      "hash64": "9DC5855CD21EDCB9",
      "text": "有人等着俺呢，\\n大家能不能先回去啊？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_girl_entry_01",
      "hash64": "43B5DA4BCCC05C43",
      "text": "好～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "5DF008B7D2FAC2E1",
      "text": "是你啊！\\n嘿！吃了吗？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_02",
      "hash64": "5DF005B7D2FABDC8",
      "text": "你在渍沁镇\\n帮了俺一个大忙啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "5DF006B7D2FABF7B",
      "text": "多亏了你，俺应该\\n能做出究极的裙带菜料理了！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "5DF00BB7D2FAC7FA",
      "text": "不过，在对战的时候\\n俺是不会手下留情的！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "5DF00CB7D2FAC9AD",
      "text": "[EMPTY 28]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "5DF009B7D2FAC494",
      "text": "拍卖比的是买卖的功夫，\\n道馆比的是拳脚的功夫。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_07",
      "hash64": "5DF00AB7D2FAC647",
      "text": "招式策略的对撞，\\n卷起漩涡的大海！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_08",
      "hash64": "5DEFFFB7D2FAB396",
      "text": "水属性宝可梦的盛宴！\\n来来，大口大口地品尝一下吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_09",
      "hash64": "5DF000B7D2FAB549",
      "text": "啊、哈、哈！俺输得就像\\n早市一样令人神清气爽啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_10",
      "hash64": "5DF38DB7D2FDDAB7",
      "text": "在你看来，俺就是只\\n菜板上的鲤鱼王！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_11",
      "hash64": "5DF38CB7D2FDD904",
      "text": "认输！卸货！\\n爆护！爆护！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_12",
      "hash64": "5DF38FB7D2FDDE1D",
      "text": "你在竞争中毫不退缩，\\n钓上来一场精彩的胜利！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_13",
      "hash64": "5DF38EB7D2FDDC6A",
      "text": "你得到道馆徽章的瞬间！\\c\\n用俺之前就一直想摆的\\n上相姿势来拍张纪念照吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_badge",
      "hash64": "49E5EBF085F3C8A5",
      "text": "有[VAR 0x0200(0001)]个道馆徽章的话，\\n等级[VAR 0x0201(0002)]以下的宝可梦会更容易捉到，\\r\\n也都会听你的话！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_badge_all",
      "hash64": "D1F9A566E5D769DD",
      "text": "有８个道馆徽章的话，\\n不管是什么样的宝可梦都能捉到，\\r\\n而且都会听你的话！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_waza",
      "hash64": "3DC23664F56B2577",
      "text": "如果是你的话，那这个招式也能熟练使用！\\n这可是吐血大优待，拿去吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_14",
      "hash64": "5DF389B7D2FDD3EB",
      "text": "好，俺差不多也该\\n开始准备开店了！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_15",
      "hash64": "5DF388B7D2FDD238",
      "text": "欢迎你再到店里来啊，\\n俺会等你的！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "BE32AE458977CF16",
      "text": "恭喜！\\n你突破了玻瓶道馆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
